<title>USA: Travelers Group Q1 EPS rises.</title>
<headline>Travelers Group Q1 EPS rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.96		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net			642,100		  520,200</p>
<p> Revs		   5,928,000		4,514,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 646,500		  637,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net before preferred divs $21 million vs $26.5 million.</p>
<p>Q1 basic net shr $1.01 vs $0.81, and basic oper shr $1.00 vs $0.74, under accounting rule 128, to be adopted Dec 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
